WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.067 --> 00:00:16.547
Aunt Judy spent all day in the kitchen.

2
00:00:16.548 --> 00:00:27.807
She made a special cake.

3
00:00:27.808 --> 00:00:36.226
The cake had raisins, carrots, and cherries.

4
00:00:36.227 --> 00:00:43.313
"I hope everyone likes my cake," said Aunt Judy.

5
00:00:43.314 --> 00:00:45.838
She gave a piece to Emmy.

6
00:00:45.839 --> 00:00:47.936
"Oh," said Emmy.

7
00:00:47.937 --> 00:00:51.869
"I don't like raisins."

8
00:00:51.870 --> 00:00:57.276
Emmy picked out the raisins.

9
00:00:57.277 --> 00:01:02.862
Aunt Judy cut a piece of cake for Dad.

10
00:01:02.863 --> 00:01:07.019
"I never eat carrots," said Dad.

11
00:01:07.020 --> 00:01:11.622
He ate everything but the carrots.

12
00:01:11.623 --> 00:01:15.899
Aunt Judy handed a piece to Harry.

13
00:01:15.900 --> 00:01:20.175
"Yuck!" said Harry. "Cherries."

14
00:01:20.176 --> 00:01:28.349
He left all of the cherries on his plate.

15
00:01:28.350 --> 00:01:32.076
Aunt Judy gave a piece to Mom.

16
00:01:32.077 --> 00:01:34.854
"Thank you," said Mom.

17
00:01:34.855 --> 00:01:39.783
"I will just eat the things that I like."

18
00:01:39.784 --> 00:01:46.004
Mom picked out the raisins, carrots, and cherries.

19
00:01:46.005 --> 00:01:49.493
She ate them all.

20
00:01:49.494 --> 00:01:52.699
Her cake now had little holes in it.

21
00:01:52.700 --> 00:01:58.137
Oliver ate his whole piece of cake.

22
00:01:58.138 --> 00:02:01.795
"I love this cake!" said Oliver.

23
00:02:01.796 --> 00:02:05.027
"I love everything in it!"

24
00:02:05.028 --> 00:02:07.699
Oliver wished he had more cake.

25
00:02:07.700 --> 00:02:14.354
He looked at everyone's plate.

26
00:02:14.355 --> 00:02:17.554
He had an idea.

27
00:02:17.555 --> 00:02:20.537
Oliver took Mom's cake.

28
00:02:20.538 --> 00:02:23.989
He went around to everyone's plate.

29
00:02:23.990 --> 00:02:35.994
He collected the raisins, carrots, and cherries.

30
00:02:35.995 --> 00:02:38.642
Oliver held up his plate.

31
00:02:38.643 --> 00:02:47.605
"I have a new piece of cake!" said Oliver.
